# 统一换行符：仓库内存储与检出都用 LF。
# Windows 下不做 autocrlf 转换，避免每次 git add 都提示
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF"，也避免 Linux 构建机与本地 diff 不一致。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须用 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析多行脚本会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.mp4   binary
